Barcelona now, a whole lot of problems in the back which were quite clearly seen. The highline if not perfect against teams with quick attackers, pays the price for it. Xavi Espart was the one positive from that defensive line today, keeping Kvicha from causing damage and also scoring a goal. Cancelo never seemed like he had a chance against Doue and the same goes for Martin. Joan Garcia probably saved Barcelona from an embarrassing scoreline with some very important saves. Onto the midfield, the part which Barca usually dominates, looked weak today, with only Pedri seemingly to be playing in midfield without any support for him from Bernal who seemed invisible and Fermin who hardly got involved. Not having Rodri starting definitely hurt the control they could''ve had but all in all Pedri was probably Barca''s best player on the pitch today even without any real support. And Barca''s attack, Lamine Yamal who did lose the ball which caused Doue to score, still attackingly I''d say had a good game. An amazing solo goal and a lot of through balls and chances created for Gordon, Raphinha and Fermin but sadly without any end product. A low performance for Yamal''s levels but still the reason they were alive in the game for a while with him being the only threat attackingly. Flick has a lot to think about before their next big game against City to prove their worth.', 4, 3, 0, '2026-10-30 20:39:12.061556+05:30', '2026-10-30 20:39:12.061556+05:30');


